    "detailed_description": "Mountain Madness is a chilled, stylized role playing game where you lead a team of climbers and helpers as they travel towards the summit of mountains around the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlan your trip carefully - you will need sufficient food, water, tents, chairs, everything!   Hire enough helpers to carry your items, but not too many that you run out of money.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful - rivers and streams block your way. Animals will try and sneak away with your food. Rocks and landslides can tumble at any minute.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAny entirely not-accurate mountain climbing adventure awaits!",
